# The talk the title starts, in the engine's `.dlg` format: one scene,
# its speaker placed with `@left`, a line of narration, and a choice whose
# replies each have their reaction.
@scene intro
@caption The north gate, at dusk
@left guide calm
guide: The road north is open again.
> Rain begins to fall.
@choice
* earnest: Then we go now.
  guide: Good. Keep close.
* wry: Then we get wet.
@endchoice
@end
